<div align="center"><h2>AGN Needs Your Help</h2></div>

<div class=default_9>

With the expansion of our network, we have grown to the point where we need YOUR help in providing the best information to the gaming community.  If you think you have what it takes, lend your support while earning great benefits at the same time.  We currently have multiple positions open on several sites:
<br><br>
<strong>SWGcenter.com</strong> - [<a href="#1">click here</a>]
<br>
<strong>WC3.WarcraftStrategy.com</strong> - [<a href="#2">click here</a>]
<br>
<strong>Brainburst.com</strong> - [<a href="#3">click here</a>]
<br><a name="1"></a>

<br><br>

<strong>SWGcenter.com</strong>
<br>
<li>Bestiary Database Moderator - inputting and updating of our MOBs, trainers, etc. (2 positions)
<li>Pet Database Moderator - inputting and updating of our Pet information (2 positions)
<li>Skill Tree Moderator - updating of our Skill Tree section (1 positions)
<li>Quest Database Moderator - inputting and updating of our Quests database (1 positions)
<br><br>

If you are interested in helping us be the best resource possible for the SWG community and receive a few great benefits in return, <a href="mailto:submit@swgcenter.com">send us an email</a>. Please include the following information: 
<br><br>

<li>Point System Username 
<li>Average amount of hours spent playing SWG weekly 
<li>Professions and levels of completion in those professions 
<li>Any other reasons or qualifications for wanting to be a contributor, and special qualifications for the position applying for
<br><br>

If selected, you will be expected to moderate and update the section of the site you are appointed to, including reviewing other entries, adding new information, and keeping your appointed section up to date.  Depending on the position, this could demand an average of an hour a day or more. In return you will get the following great benefits:
<br><br>

<li>Premium Membership for all of the AGN Premium sites during your tenure! 
<li>Moderator status for the section of the site that you are updating and recognition for that section of the site.
<li>The knowledge that you are helping to create the ultimate resource for the SWG community. 

<br><a name="2"></a>
<br>
<br>
<strong>WC3.WarcraftStrategy.com</strong>
<br>
<li>Feature Article Authors (7 positions) - weekly article author (articles include strategy, interviews, or comics)
<li>Replay Reviewers (4 positions) - weekly replay entrant and reviewer
<li>Event Coordinators (positions TBA) - to coordinate future events
<br><br>

If you are interested in helping us be the best resource possible for the WCS community and receive a few great benefits in return, <a href="mailto:submit@warcraftstrategy.com">send us an email</a>. Please include the following information: 
<br><br>

<li>Server Played on, level, and preferred race
<li>Past experience, if any, including links
<li>Any other reasons or qualifications for wanting to be a contributor
<br><br>

If selected, Feature Article Authors will be expected to submit one weekly article for us to feature on the community side of the site, and to enter in supporting replays for that article.  If selected, Replay Reviewers will be expected to submit one weekly batch of hot replays, each reviewed or summarized for us to feature on the community side of the site.  (Event Coordinator positions and benefits will be defined by the ability of those who apply.)  In return you will get the following great benefits:
<br><br>

<li>Premium Membership for all of the AGN Premium sites during your tenure! 
<li>Forum title designating you as a WCS Feature Author
<li>The knowledge that you are helping to create the ultimate resource for the WC3 community. 
<br><a name="3"></a>
<br>
<br>

<strong>Brainburst.com</strong>
<br>
<li>Card of the Week Artist (1 position)
<li>Feature Comic Author (1 position)
<br><br>

If you are interested in helping us be the best resource possible for the Magic community and receive a few great benefits in return, <a href="mailto:submit@brainburst.com">send us an email</a>. Please include the following information: 
<br><br>

<li>Name
<li>Photoshop or other image program experience
<li>Three sample Fantasy Card creations, or three sample comic creations
<br><br>

If selected, you will be expected to create the weekly Card of the Week/Comic images for Brainburst.com.  If needed, helpful hints and instructions will be forwarded. In return you will get the following great benefits:
<br><br>

<li>Premium Membership for all of the AGN Premium sites during your tenure! 
<li>Forum title designating you as the Brainburst CotW/Comic Artist
<li>The knowledge that you are helping to create the ultimate resource for the Magic community. 
<br><br>
Note: Comic author may earn more depending on ability and consistancy.


</div>

<br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br>

